### User: It is doing like this 37.5Â°C

**Issue:** Character encoding issue - degree symbol not being sent as UTF-8

**Fix:** Added `charset=utf-8` to content-type header:
```cpp
server.send(200, "text/html; charset=utf-8", INDEX_HTML);
```

